                   Cytotoxicity Assessment of Heavy Metal Arsenic
                       (Arsenic Trioxide) Using Nigella sativa L.
                            (Black Cumin) as Test System
                           Ankita Pramanik1, Animesh Kumar Datta1*, Sudha Gupta2,
                              Sandipon Basu2, Debadrito Das3 and Bapi Ghosh4
                     1
                       Department of Botany, Cytogenetics, Genetics and Plant Breeding Section, University of Kalyani,
                       Kalyani-741235, West Bengal, India
                     2
                       Department of Botany, Pteridology-Palaeobotany Section, University of Kalyani,
                       Kalyani-741235, West Bengal, India
                     3
                       Department of Botany, Saraswati Degree Vidya Mandir, Berhampur 760001, Odisha, India
                     4
