     2.3 Data statistical assessment

     Data statistical analysis was performed by using extended MS Excel data analysis tool QI
     Macros, involving the application of ANOVA test.


     3 Results and discussion

     3.1 Results

     3.1.1 Total concentration of As in ITF-mix
     The average total concentration of As in analyzed samples of ITF-mix was 0.16 mg kg-1.
     ITF-mix produced in Turkey contained a higher concentration of As than ITF-mix
     produced in Libya (Table 2). However, according to ANOVA, the concentration of As in
     various ITF-mix samples was not significant (P = 0.34).
